		<tr>
	<td id="1440697228_MCS_S_3" valign="top" >
	
	<div class="mainContentSet">
	
	<b class="spiffy"><b class="spiffy1"><b></b></b><b class="spiffy2"><b></b></b><b class="spiffy3"></b><b class="spiffy4"></b><b class="spiffy5"></b></b>
	
		<div class="title">PIPES Act Signed</div>
		
		<div class="description">On December 29th President Bush signed HR 5782, the Pipeline Inspection, Protection, Enforcement and Safety Act (PIPES Act) of 2006.  It will greatly improve safety and strengthen Federal and state pipeline safety programs.  Implementing the new law will be a priority for PHMSA in 2007 and beyond.

Outreach and discussion has begun on HAZMAT reauthorization which will be an issue in the next (2007) Congress.</div>
		
					       	<div class="item">
					       		<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
					       		<tr>
					       			<td valign="top"><div class="bullet">&nbsp;</div></td>
					       			<td><a href="http://frwebgate.access.gpo.gov/cgi-bin/getdoc.cgi?dbname=109_cong_public_laws&docid=f:publ468.109.pdf" title="Pipes Act (PDF)" >Pipes Act (PDF)</a></td>
					       		</tr>
					       		
					       			<tr>
					       				<td></td>
					       				<td><span class="itemDescription">You can also read the <a href="http://frwebgate.access.gpo.gov/cgi-bin/getdoc.cgi?dbname=109_cong_public_laws&docid=f:publ468.109" title="text version (opens in a new window)" target="_new">text-only</a> version.</span></td>
					       			</tr>
					       			
					       		</table>	
					       	</div>
					       	
</div>
</td>
</tr>
		
		<tr>
